    "title": "William James Novack | Around The Web | wvnews.com",
    "text": "November 12, 1951 - September 4, 2025\nWilliam James Novack William \"Billy Bones\" James Novack passed away on September 4, 2025, after a brief illness. Bill was born on November 12, 1951, in Chicago, Illinois to William F. Novack and Genevieve Pieratt. He was the 3rd born of seven children. The family moved from Chicago to Butte in 1954. Bill attended Longfellow Elementary School, East Junior High, and graduated from Butte High in 1969.",
